   "widgets_values": [
    "One square image strictly divided into a 3x3 grid of nine equal panels, three rows by three columns, each panel separated by a clean straight white dividing line, like a storyboard sheet. No element may cross or overlap the dividing lines; every panel is one independent complete film frame. All nine panels feature exactly the same character in the same location: a cheerful young woman baker with shoulder-length black hair, neat straight bangs, round silver-framed glasses, wearing a moss-green apron over a cream blouse with rolled-up sleeves and a small red neckerchief, inside her warm rustic bakery kitchen with wooden shelves, hanging copper pans, linen flour sacks, and soft morning sunlight streaming through a large window. The character design, outfit, hairstyle, glasses and drawing style stay identical in every panel. Panel 1 (top-left), wide shot: she pushes open the wooden front door of the bakery, morning light spilling across the floor; Panel 2 (top-center), full shot: she stands at the wooden work table tying the strings of her moss-green apron behind her back; Panel 3 (top-right), medium shot: she kneads a mound of white dough with both hands, flour dust floating in the air; Panel 4 (middle-left), close-up: the dough turns smooth and round under her palms on the flour-dusted table; Panel 5 (middle-center), medium shot: she lowers the dough into a brown clay bowl and covers it with a damp cloth; Panel 6 (middle-right), medium close-up: she leans slightly sideways with eyes curved into a smile, smelling the rising dough; Panel 7 (bottom-left), full shot: she slides a tray of shaped loaves into the brick oven with a long wooden peel; Panel 8 (bottom-center), medium shot: golden crusty loaves come out of the oven with rising steam as she reaches in with oven mitts; Panel 9 (bottom-right), close-up: she lifts a warm round loaf up to the window light and smiles gently."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "value": "(写画面提示词:人物/姿态/场景/光线;尺度放开由 LoRA 栈承担,可直写人体描述)正向提示词 (Prompt):\n\n(masterpiece, best quality:1.2), traditional Chinese Gongbi painting, meticulous brushwork, exquisite Chinese beauty, serene and noble expression, willow-leaf eyebrows, delicate phoenix eyes, dressed in elegant Song-style silk ruqun, soft pastel tones, pale celadon and off-white silk, gossamer ribbon, holding a translucent round silk fan with floral painting, hair adorned with a simple jade hairpin, leaning against a garden balustrade with blooming crabapple branches, antique silk scroll texture, delicate mineral pigment wash, clean precise line art, subtle color gradation, peaceful atmosphere, 8k resolution\n\n(中文意境：传统工笔画，工细笔触，绝美仕女，宁静温雅，柳叶眉丹凤眼，宋制素雅丝绸襦裙，青白淡色，手执透纱花鸟团扇，玉簪绾发，依倚庭院海棠花窗，古旧绢本肌理，矿物淡彩渲染，精准细线勾勒)"
